 "text": "Hi, how's everything with you? Fresh fruit, crackers, cheese, an apple sauce bag, and some crackers are easy to take and don't need any special equipment. You can also buy a small box of crackers. Then pick a scenic trail, not one that's too steep. Take a jacket as the air can get cold. A light sweater is useful too. A box of crackers and an apple sauce bag can share quite a lot of the sandwiches. A box of crackers and an apple can share quite a lot of sandwiches. Want to bring utensils just pack them in the tiny box. A fork is useful.",
